~ harbour_master
Harbour Master: The keeper hasn't lit the lamp in two nights.
if has("clue.lighthouse.letter"):
	Harbour Master: A letter? He wrote to his sister every week.
if has("clue.keeper.found"):
	Harbour Master: So he's safe after all. Thank goodness.
- Ask about the boat [if has("clue.boat.missng") /]
	Harbour Master: His boat was gone from the mooring at dawn.
	do set_fact("clue.harbour.testimony")
- Leave
=> END
